# Apple Essential Direct
# Focused on Apple infrastructure where mainland DIRECT is normally beneficial.
# This is intentionally NOT a blanket `apple.com` rule: Apple TV+, News and other
# region-sensitive content remain on the ordinary overseas route unless explicitly listed.
# Cross-checked against Apple's current enterprise-network requirements.

